        "maxwidthoftitlemobiled_": 20,
        "bodytextOnlyTextCTA_": "These are the pieces that didn’t make it to launch for small but meaningful reasons: colors we loved but didn’t release, knits that came out half an inch off (yes, we’re that precise), beautiful styles that didn’t make the final cut. They may not be flawless, but they carry the same craftsmanship, softness, and intention behind every stitch. And they deserve a second chance.\n\nWe have 151 pieces available, and it’s first come, first served. Prices start at €20, and all items are final sale.\n\n\nIf you have any questions, reach out to hello@theknottyones.com",
